    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38361" root="مر" body-key="m">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مرّرهُ</span></b> , (inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمْرِيرٌ</span>, TA,) <i>He,</i> or <i>it, made
it bitter;</i> (S, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">امرّهُ</span></b> : (IAar, S:)
or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَّهُ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرُ3َ</span></b> , has this signification, and the
first verb has an intensive signification [<i>he,</i> or
<i>it, made it very bitter</i>]. (Msb.)

